# Absolving Lammasu: "all suspected creatures are no longer suspected" (CR 701.60a) names creatures, not permanents. Bot1's J. Jonah Jameson suspects Bot2's Memnite on turn 3, and on turn 5 Imprisoned in the
# Moon makes it a colorless land that loses all other card types (CR 305.7, 205.1b): suspected is a designation, not part of its copiable values (CR 701.60b), and it keeps it. When the Lammasu enters on turn 7
# the land is no creature and stays suspected.

